# 🔥 Fire and Smoke Detection using YOLOv12

Real-time Fire and Smoke Detection system built with **YOLOv12**, OpenCV and Python.

The model detects:

- 🔥 Fire
- 🌫️ Smoke

and draws bounding boxes with confidence scores on images and videos.

---

