## Dataset

Custom Fire and Smoke Detection Dataset.

Classes:

- Fire
- Smoke

---

## Results

Example detections:

- 🔥 Fire confidence: 79.7%
- 🌫️ Smoke confidence: 42.4%

Inference speed:

- ~200 ms/frame on CPU
- Faster on GPU

